    codeExample: "<section class=\"mall\">\n  <h1 class=\"full\">ｗｅｌｃｏｍｅ</h1>\n  <p>＞ the future, as recalled.</p>\n  <button class=\"btn-vhs\">E N T E R</button>\n</section>",
