    accessibility: "Ink 12.9:1 on cream; rye 4.6:1 on cream (large text and fills only); sour red 4.4:1 and always accompanied by a word. Focus 3px rye ring. Decorative ruled backgrounds are aria-hidden.",
    responsive: "The day ruler compacts from a full label column to an inline chip under 700px; cards go single column; display type clamps 28 → 54px.",
