    codeExample: "<section class=\"book\">\n  <h1>The ledger is <em>open.</em></h1>\n  <dl class=\"pair\"><dt>ETH/USD</dt><dd>3,412.08 <span class=\"up\">▲1.8%</span></dd></dl>\n  <button class=\"btn-signal\">Trade now</button>\n</section>",
