    designDetails: "Iron #17181a canvas, chalk #f2f0eb, plate-red #d33f2e for PRs and alerts. Alfa Slab One display, Figtree body. Rep-scheme tables, rest-timer rings, and plate-math graphics (45/25/10/5). Hard 6px shadows, square corners, uppercase everything short.",
