    codeExample: "<article class=\"dossier\">\n  <p class=\"stamp\">Case 4471 · Open</p>\n  <h1>The <em>quiet</em> disappearance.</h1>\n  <p>Filed Tuesday. Never followed up.</p>\n</article>",
